 "summary": "New declarations have no located Mathlib or Tau Ceti counterpart: `IsCoeffMap.mapL` generalises beyond the scalar `contDiffOnSMulL`, the single-atlas `transferL` and the constant `constMapL` by allowing an operator coefficient between distinct chart data. `clm_bundle_equiv_symm` and `toContinuousLinearMap_restrictScalars'` are new conveniences built directly on `clm_bundle_inverse` and `restrictScalars'`, and the transport and index results reuse `Wkp.contDiffOnCLMApplyL`, `coord_hom_apply`, `denseRange_ofContMDiffSection`, `isFredholm_sobolevL` and `index_comp_equiv`/`index_equiv_comp`.",
